<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.convivy.weekly-consulting</string>

  <!-- The weekly outside-view strategy brief (ARCH-158). Fires Sunday 03:00
       local. The consultant studies the evolving industry practice of building
       agent systems, assesses our substrate against it, writes a one-page brief
       to knowledge agent-platform/briefs/, and opens a PR (the operator merges). Sunday
       03:00 is the weekend long-form slot (weekday news Mon-Fri 03:00, engineering
       deep-dive Sat 03:00); 03:00 clears the overnight orchestrator's 01:00 spawn
       wave and the local-day budget (ARCH-156) is still fresh. Same budget pool/cap
       as the overnight job (DAILY_BUDGET_USD); agentctl gates the spawn.
       AGENT_RUN_ORIGIN is also exported by the launcher. Cadence per the operator,
       2026-06-27.

       Deploy-pinned per platform/decisions/0059 rule 1
       (issue_01M19RRWSS9ETR09N9M2BJPA0Q): a timer firing unattended is
       production USE of launch-weekly-consulting, not someone working on it,
       so this reads a COPY installed from `main` into
       ~/.local/deploy/agent-platform-shared/ (rules 2, 6, 7) instead of the
       ~/.local/bin symlink into the checkout — that symlink still exists and
       still reaches the tree, for the person who re-invokes
       launch-weekly-consulting interactively while working on it (rule 5).
       bin/agent-platform-autopull refreshes the deploy area on every
       origin/main advance; bin/install-agent-platform-shared is what actually
       builds it.
       argv stays a single entry (rule 4 pins the INTERPRETER; the entry
       point here is a shell script, not a python one, and the deploy area
       builds no shell of its own) — the script itself moves to the deploy
       area's copy and is run by its own path. -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>__HOME__/.local/deploy/agent-platform-shared/bin/launch-weekly-consulting</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>__HOME__/.local/deploy/agent-platform-shared</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>DAILY_BUDGET_USD</key>
    <string>50</string>
    <key>AGENT_RUN_ORIGIN</key>
    <string>scheduled</string>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>__HOME__/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin</string>
  </dict>

  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Weekday</key>
    <integer>0</integer>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>3</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>0</integer>
  </dict>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>__HOME__/Convivy/agent-runs/weekly-consulting-launcher.out.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>__HOME__/Convivy/agent-runs/weekly-consulting-launcher.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
